{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_synopsis", "source_sha256": "464b9e9b87343756bad889e307a2c67fa9012ab440bf3797eeceffb1268f0b04", "ja": "どこか元気のない響。出演した沖縄フェア\nでの出来事から、今回、目指していたことを\n実現するのは難しいかもと、悩んでしまった\nらしい。だが、みんなの言葉で自信を取り\n戻し、響は改めて自分の目標を宣言した。", "zh": "响看起来有些无精打采。原来是因为\n参加冲绳物产展时发生的事，让她烦恼起\n这次的目标或许很难实现。但在大家的鼓励下\n响找回了自信，再次宣告了自己的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1000_013hib", "source_sha256": "8efdb0e54202fba3f0d117789f1b732ddafa2ec0e28c2da95e8a404a65ba5581", "ja": "一緒に歌ってくれてありがとー！\nみんなの声、しっかり響いてたからね～！", "zh": "谢谢你陪我一起唱——！\n大家的歌声，我都清楚地听到了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "29de350a06f5a39fa537846bf0bac121b7e24086720ddd096dc788e132fd43ba", "ja": "ワアァァァッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "9b9b9aab2e5a43fbb7dd03c5a69ef882f7387f8337b17489f3a470f020980062", "ja": "自分ね、ライブの最後はこの曲でみんなと\n盛り上がりたかったんだ！", "zh": "我本来想在演出的最后用这首歌和大家一起嗨起来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "421d35bbf0d0e8f802f75ea67fbb91cb0cc445eedd7d6f77d7dd76110b1ccf2f", "ja": "明日からも、毎日この曲を口ずさんで……\nみんなの活力にしてもらえたらうれしいぞ～！", "zh": "从明天开始，也希望大家每天都哼唱这首歌……\n把它化作活力哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "29de350a06f5a39fa537846bf0bac121b7e24086720ddd096dc788e132fd43ba", "ja": "ワアァァァッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1005_p", "source_sha256": "58b9e4351640076480065a9aa24cd0410ab643cfd5e184524f155e03165d7e06", "ja": "響、お疲れさま！　よくやったな。\nすごく楽しいステージだったよ！", "zh": "响，辛苦了！干得漂亮。\n真是一场特别开心的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "4918fbe4073ae35de5c109b77632231354496e1fe0a50a68425b3df4e974fe1a", "ja": "えへへ、当然でしょ！\nだって自分、カンペキだからね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，那当然啦！\n因为我可是完美的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "f2a2d829d8f89f15a3d06aed2e45b922f31dbaa044a2a7c9f7a0453e2a026872", "ja": "それに、自分もステージで感じられたんだ。\nここにいるみんなが、楽しんでくれてるって！", "zh": "而且，我也能在舞台上感受到。\n在场的大家都玩得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fed5fa1fd4e96be1b75bffe5dd3522ef2767c9b8731d2e2ee50bb13bd121b46a", "ja": "うん……私も、すごく感じたよ。\nお客さんたちの、楽しそうな空気……。", "zh": "嗯……我也深深感受到了哦。\n观众们那种很开心的氛围……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4e40eedbbc75937c55851bbb15416e2c58ea250289cf3ea4f13bf2834baa31e8", "ja": "やっぱり、響ちゃんはすごいなぁ。みんなのこと、\nこんなにも笑顔にできちゃうんだから。", "zh": "响真的好厉害啊。竟然能让大家\n露出这么灿烂的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "8188ae8bc17afa7832f6196285d64844b37b7590335402d29a59124a4d4d772d", "ja": "はいっ！　ありさにも、響ちゃんの\n海人魂、ばっちり伝わってきました！", "zh": "是！连亚利沙也充分感受到了响的海人精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "635bcba0f2f0944923c56821c245af2f77592a1988daf6a112ff5a743cb1c32d", "ja": "ビーチではしゃぐアイドルちゃんたちの姿が、\n今にも目に浮かぶようで……ふぉぉ……！", "zh": "海滩上嬉闹的偶像们的身影，简直仿佛随时都会浮现在眼前……呜哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "504cfd65e1e65503721e0c0f0d03300dcb742d4d28e0515eb3049841886a2f58", "ja": "ホント、楽しかった～！　ファンのみんなも、\n明日からの活力、ばっちり蓄えられたんじゃない？", "zh": "真的好开心啊～！粉丝们也一定都为明天之后的日子，充分积攒了活力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "27f4d503bd6d91bbda4da9cb9a7025ba724442eb17f06a827b145f00a3c7dfa8", "ja": "ヒビキはやっぱり、みーんなの元気の源ってコトだネ！", "zh": "果然，响就是大家的活力之源呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "80fb95dd920e5a29ea0eedee195d16a2223f10d11edd1436ff83d583039896a2", "ja": "みんな……えへへっ。でしょ！\nでも自分、これで終わりにしたくないんだ！", "zh": "大家……嘿嘿。对吧！\n不过我自己，可不想就这样结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "7f681969c412b75c9765033f33578723efa35019d6ac72cf4c1e5113329a5889", "ja": "{$P$}。やって欲しいことが\nあるんだけど、後で聞いてくれる？", "zh": "{$P$}。我有件事想请你做，之后能听我说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c5914cec8a11ed8615c7c86ad50c7d3440f2c251e45f1733f0dd1992fb587be4", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　けど後でいいのか？\nなんだか気になるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，当然可以！不过，真的之后再说也行吗？\n总觉得有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "e13bf6d0a4ae548ec69aadca6d18f871e1f18a4bdba18c1b304edc9348c2a238", "ja": "ワタシも～！\nねぇヒビキ、今は教えてくれないノ？", "zh": "我也是～！\n呐，响，现在不能告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "885293f28d6e2f8bfb226a0f6b07fedae5afc64fc4aced8ae8124777ff423754", "ja": "それは……せっかくだから、打ち上げで話すね！", "zh": "这个嘛……难得有这个机会，还是等庆功宴时再告诉你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "2a82daa53cbbc456f59bf464aade057a1ea3f4bec3b1f9def495baad36a91474", "ja": "ええっ！？　ここで、まさかの引き……！\n響ってば、最後まで盛り上げ上手だな～。", "zh": "诶诶！？居然在这里卖关子……！\n响真是到最后都很会炒热气氛啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "b02dc1e2590b7685cff2bcd840384dd6e373b4dd9481c855ed61afa6c142e9ed", "ja": "えへへっ♪　だって、そのほうが楽しいでしょ？\nみんなにも、ワクワクしてもらいたいからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 因为那样更有趣嘛，对吧？\n我也想让大家都兴奋起来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "4410400d3c275173600967369b9a00b6d809d5b33fcb4d8d66a66ced30f24ee2", "ja": "それじゃみんな、早く着替えよう！\n{$P$}、また後でね！", "zh": "那么大家，快点去换衣服吧！\n{$P$}，待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1022_p", "source_sha256": "93d36fee9e50291e9d26e22fb91e11bacc6f4065d5e42c16665b9d186f4c6ce6", "ja": "（あれだけみんなを盛り上げた直後で、\n響はもう、次を見据えている……）", "zh": "（刚刚才那样带动了大家的气氛，响已经在展望下一步了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_091_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_091_1023_p", "source_sha256": "84ab97b9619680183bac834992ed58777171c53fc720925008edbfba864ede98", "ja": "（ビーチのお祭りは、まだまだ続きそうだな！）", "zh": "（海滩上的庆典，看来还会继续下去啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
